{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddea Become a Slime Scientist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is your own lab where all the slime-making happens. You\u2019ve got everything you need to mix, stretch, and get creative\u2014powered by a real-time fluid simulation system. Combine ingredients to create your own slime from scratch. Experiment to find your favorite formula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/1_mix.gif?t=1747962225\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 Customize Your Slime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are endless combinations!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play around with tons of colors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add charms, glow effects, and tweak the stickiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melt it down or freeze it into a new shape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whatever theme you're feeling\u2014cozy, creepy, colorful\u2014you've got the charms to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/2_charms.gif?t=1747962225\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddfe Fulfill Customer Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're not just creating for fun\u2014customers are counting on you! Match their orders as best you can, and see how your creations measure up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce6 Run the Lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your lab stocked and running. Order supplies, upgrade your tools, and unlock new ingredients. The better your setup, the more you can create.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683570?t=1747962225","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/0c414038a862dee184d6d51c18987be83ccc9da3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747962225","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/fdd3cff4103854879f892b218b7c2d2eb984b60e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747962225","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/fdd3cff4103854879f892b218b7c2d2eb984b60e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747962225","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddea Become a Slime Scientist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is your own lab where all the slime-making happens. You\u2019ve got everything you need to mix, stretch, and get creative\u2014powered by a real-time fluid simulation system. Combine ingredients to create your own slime from scratch. Experiment to find your favorite formula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/1_mix.gif?t=1747962225\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 Customize Your Slime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are endless combinations!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play around with tons of colors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add charms, glow effects, and tweak the stickiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melt it down or freeze it into a new shape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whatever theme you're feeling\u2014cozy, creepy, colorful\u2014you've got the charms to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/2_charms.gif?t=1747962225\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddfe Fulfill Customer Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're not just creating for fun\u2014customers are counting on you! Match their orders as best you can, and see how your creations measure up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce6 Run the Lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your lab stocked and running. Order supplies, upgrade your tools, and unlock new ingredients. The better your setup, the more you can create.</p>","developers":["Retrocell LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/c03ef1bf2807e8d6afba5e04b924668ea3f432e3/header.jpg?t=1747962225","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140453,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140453/movie480.mp4?t=1747962223","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140453/movie_max.mp4?t=1747962223"},"name":"Announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140453/1154478ee3400cadae4d95a08903fc394106e976/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747962223","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140453/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747962223","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140453/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747962223"}}],"name":"Slime Lab","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u202f10/11 (64\u2011bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 / AMD equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 / AMD equivalent or 